<p>
  Hello,
</p>

<p>
  <strong><%= @minor.name || @minor.email %></strong> has invited you to be their guardian on Fuime,
  the financial platform for teen businesses.
</p>

<p>
  <strong>What this means:</strong> As their guardian, you'll be the legal signer for their business account.
  You'll be able to see all their transactions, and you'll receive important notifications about their account.
</p>

<p>
  <strong>Your responsibilities:</strong>
</p>
<ul>
  <li>Oversee their business finances</li>
  <li>Be the legal signer on the account</li>
  <li>Help them with tax paperwork when needed</li>
</ul>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Accept Guardian Invitation", @accept_url, class: "btn" %>
</p>

<p>
  If you did not expect this invitation, or if you don't know <%= @minor.name || @minor.email %>,
  you can safely ignore this email.
</p>

<p>
  Questions? Reply to this email or contact us at support@fuime.com.
</p>

<p>
  Best,<br>
  The Fuime Team
</p>
